{"parents": [], "prev": {"link": "../requests.models/", "title": "requests.models"}, "next": {"link": "../requests.exceptions/", "title": "requests.exceptions"}, "title": "requests.auth", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-requests.auth\">\n<span id=\"requests-auth\"></span><h1>requests.auth<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-requests.auth\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<section id=\"id1\">\n<h2>requests.auth<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id1\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<p>This module contains the authentication handlers for Requests.</p>\n</section>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.AuthBase\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">requests.auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">AuthBase</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.AuthBase\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Base class that all auth implementations derive from</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPBasicAuth\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">requests.auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">HTTPBasicAuth</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">username</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">password</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPBasicAuth\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Attaches HTTP Basic Authentication to the given Request object.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPProxyAuth\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">requests.auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">HTTPProxyAuth</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">username</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">password</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPProxyAuth\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Attaches HTTP Proxy Authentication to a given Request object.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">requests.auth.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">HTTPDigestAuth</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">username</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">password</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Attaches HTTP Digest Authentication to the given Request object.</p>\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.build_digest_header\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">build_digest_header</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">method</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">url</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.build_digest_header\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>str</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.handle_redirect\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">handle_redirect</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">r</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.handle_redirect\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Reset num_401_calls counter on redirects.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py method\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.handle_401\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">handle_401</span></span><span class=\"sig-paren\">(</span><em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">r</span></span></em>, <em class=\"sig-param\"><span class=\"o\"><span class=\"pre\">**</span></span><span class=\"n\"><span class=\"pre\">kwargs</span></span></em><span class=\"sig-paren\">)</span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#requests.auth.HTTPDigestAuth.handle_401\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Takes the given response and tries digest-auth, if needed.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>requests.Response</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "in